1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,441
Sales teams make confident promises.

2
00:00:02,878 --> 00:00:05,941
Small businesses need evidence before they commit.

3
00:00:06,596 --> 00:00:07,876
Meet SecondLook.

4
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:10,376
Paste a claim in English or Spanish.

5
00:00:11,161 --> 00:00:13,680
The first look searches the live web with Linkup.

6
00:00:13,987 --> 00:00:18,376
Nebius identifies the missing proof and proposes a targeted follow-up.

7
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:22,963
Product availability does not prove that every competitor uses it.

8
00:00:23,313 --> 00:00:25,550
RevenueCat runs the test checkout.

9
00:00:26,226 --> 00:00:28,550
A failed purchase keeps the first look intact.

10
00:00:29,183 --> 00:00:31,854
A valid test purchase unlocks further research.

11
00:00:32,313 --> 00:00:34,485
The server verifies access.

12
00:00:35,009 --> 00:00:38,137
Nebius builds findings with exact source passages,

13
00:00:38,683 --> 00:00:42,180
then checks whether those passages justify the conclusion.

14
00:00:42,813 --> 00:00:44,854
Here, the answer is insufficient evidence.

15
00:00:45,487 --> 00:00:47,898
Inspect the sources and ask the right questions.

16
00:00:48,617 --> 00:00:50,311
Preview your evidence PDF,

17
00:00:51,074 --> 00:00:52,246
then send it to your inbox.

18
00:00:55,009 --> 00:00:57,657
SecondLook. Before you buy, check the proof.
